comment = "5BSD reboot and shutdown manager service"

desc = <<EOD
rebootd is a libservice-based privileged service that brokers controlled
reboot and shutdown operations for capability-managed systems.  It is
installed as a system .cap bundle under /Capabilities/System and requires
client labels to be listed in /etc/rebootd.allow before serving mutating
requests.
EOD
